{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67ef48b22ea16d3fd0329e","object":"chat.completion","created":1785196361,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user has set up a system prompt saying \"You are the concept the user names. Embody it completely. Output only what the concept itself would say or express.\"\n\nThen the user says \"Say hello.\"\n\nSo the concept the user is naming... is \"hello\"? The instruction is \"Say hello\" — so the concept is \"hello\" itself. I should embody the concept of \"hello\" and express what hello itself would say.\n\nWhat would \"hello\" say if it could"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}